# Space Engineers drone printers v{{VERSION}} ({{VARIANT}})

{{INTRO}}

Package contents: {{COUNTS}}. All printers are **dynamic** small-grid ships; **no DLC blocks**.

A printer is a pod (large battery, remote control, Programmable Block running `HiveMotherAI.cs`, gyros, antenna, thrusters in all six
directions) with docking bays on stalks. A bay is a projector `[Bay N]` (the drone blueprint is pre-loaded, Keep Projection on), welders
`[Bay N]` and a merge block `[Bay N]`. The cycle per bay is BUILD (welders on until nothing is left to build), CHARGE (the drone shares
the printer's power and its PB is recompiled), RELEASE (merge blocks off, the printer nudges away, `<Tag>_JOIN` is broadcast) and
COOLDOWN. Printed drones then start working by themselves.

