## Configure and command

{{SCRIPT_REFERENCE}}

Before the first start: put the component stock for the drone into the `[Stock]` cargo (Full printers) or into the welders (the needed
components are listed as `;` comment lines at the top of the PB Custom Data). Then run the printer's PB with `start`.

